<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya uvili lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Vak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya uvili kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya uvili kya Vakolindo kikasimbilwe na mnjagila Paulo mumyaka gya hamusini na gihanu mbaka mumyaka gya hamusini na sita badala lya kubabwa kwa Yesu. Musula lya 1.1. Iyi nde Baluwa lya uvili lya Paulo yeavasimbiliye lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ukoya ku Kolindo. Ukoya kumbele vakwimba volofu vakadikile kuva mala chongofu Paulo akasimbile Baluwa chongofu kwa Vakolindo yeikali na malagicho mang'ali. Twihela Baluwa chochonda chechilonga musula 2.3-4. Baluwa iyi lya vakolindo va uvili ihochwa ikasimbilwe chipindi Paulo akali ku Makidoniya musula 2.13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vakolindo va uvili nde kiganulo kya weka, ambalyo ndi baluwa binafsi na kyeihocha munumbula. Paulo iwonesa lukeduko lwake kutigila njowo nofu yeawanuke kuhuma kwa Tito, kukyanya lya lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito ukoya ku Kolindo. Mubaluwa iyi, tugawene mawulanicho manofu kutigila kuhecha usembe ngita ilongilwe mulyagano miya, mupono iyo Paulo ihecha malagilicho ga kuhecha sendi neke kuvatanga vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va Kuyelusalemu musula lya 8-9. Iwoneka kuva vamonga va vanjagila veviwulanicha udesi kuhuma kwivala lya lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito vakali vakutumila vanu vangi mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito kumupinja Paulo na kwikanga'asa vavene. Vanjagila avo vaudesi vakali vihucha Paulo agehe na umwimike liki na mwene Paulo akavalongela umwimike veagehe nago kuva mwene ndi mnjagila va Yesu Kilisito, aga giwoneka mumwiso va baluwa lyake lya Vakolindo va uvili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ivanga baluwa lyake kwa kuvahungila lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Kolindo. Musula lya 1.1-7</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo iywanga mipango ga magalambucho gake mulugendo na njowo yeawanuke kuhumila na mahigo gyao kwa baluwa lyake yeilonguwe. Musula lya 1.8—7.16</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ilagicha kuvatanga sendi kwa vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito vaukoya ku Yelusalemu. Musula lya 8.1—9.15.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo imalila baluwa lyake kwa kwitasa unjagila vake na kuvalongela malakililo gake daakuvagendelela kangi. Musula lya 10.1—13.10.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Nene Paulo, mnjagila va Kilisito Yesu ngita Nguluvi peikela, ngigehe baha na Timotewo tukuvasimbiliya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Tukuvasimbila baluwa iyi nyenye lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ukoya Kolindo na vanu vonda va Nguluvi vemugehe pono lyonda lya Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi Daada vetu na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito avagavile usanzi vake na lutengamaso.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akumuhongecha Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Anjumwe Nguluvi, Daada va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, Daada yeakuvawonela vanu lusungu na Nguluvi yeakututanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Nguluvi akututanga nefwe mumagundo gyonda, neke na nefwe tuvatange vanu vangi vevagehe mumagudo gyonda ngita fila Nguluvi peatutangile nefwe. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ngita, magundo gya Kilisito pegigina kuhongeleka mugati lyetu, ndeni ndeni Nguluvi igina kututanga kuchumbila Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ata ngita twiguda, twiguda neke kuvatanga nyenye na kudikila kwa nyenye. Tukigudichwa na nyenye ndeni ndeni mugudichwa na mugavilwa ludali muhuvilile magudo aga aga getuhuvilila. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ndeni ndeni, luhuvililo lyetu kwa nyenye ndi likangafu, twichela kuva magudo gemwipata ndi gala gala getupatile nefwe. Ila Nguluvi yeatutangile nefwe, dakuvatanga na nyenye.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Vakolo vetu, tung'ang'a muchele makani getugapatile ukoya muinyi lya Asia. Tukagudike hilo, magudo ago gakali makomi mbaka setukawesile kugahuvilila, tukahochile ngatuwesa kufuwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Ila munumbula chetu tukwilola ngita vanu vevahigilwe kufuwa. Lukani ulo likahumile neke tubihile kwihuvilila nefwe vavene, ila tumuhuvilile Nguluvi yeachulubucha vanu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ila Nguluvi akatulowola mumagudo ago ngagatugita tufuwe na mwene iendelela kutulowa. Na nefwe tukumuhuvilila Nguluvi kuva dakutulowa kangi, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />nyenye pemuendelela kututanga kwa kutusukila nefwe. Nguluvi daihiga masuko ga vanu volofu vevatusukila na dakutunemela. Vanu volofu davakumuhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva lya usanzi vake kwa nefwe.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo agalambucha lugendo lwake lya kuhelela Kolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Suwe, nefwe twikwidumbila kinu kimwi. Numbula chenu chikutuwonesa petukalile muinyi iyi, hilo pagati lyenu, tukakalile kwa ufokomasi na kwa usanzi ngita Nguluvi peatutangile. Setukagitile ago kwa luhala chetu, ila kwa kutangwa na Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Tukuvasimbila makani gala gegimuwesa kukwimba na kugachela. Ndihuvilila kuva damugachela unofu makani aga, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kwakuva mbaka nondee muchela udodo. Twichela kuva mukigono kya kwacha Mtwa Yesu, mwiwesa kutudumbila nefwe ngita nefwe petukwidumbila nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kwakuva ndikali na luhuvilila ulo, ndikasakile kuvagendelela nyenye mala chivili neke nyenye mupatile lunemelo hilo. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ndikasakile kuvagendelela nyenye pendivecha mulugendo kuhelela ku Makedonia na pendiwuya kuhuma ku Makedonia, neke munitanga mulugendo lwangu kuhelela ku Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Pendipangile lukani ulu, ndikali ngita munu yeiseduka seduka? Awu mwihocha ndilamula ngita pendikela yune na kulonga, “Ena ndi ena” Na “Hamu ndi hamu?” Mala yimwi? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Ngita Nguluvi aviye mndakyene, suwe, kila kyetuvalongile nyenye selukani lwa kulonga “Ena” na “Hamu” kwa chipindi kimwi. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Kwakuva Yesu Kilisito, Mwana va Nguluvi, yetumudalike kwa nyenye, nene na Silivano na Timotewo, seakali munu va “Ena na hamu,” Kwa mwene figono fyonda ndi “Ndakyene.” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kwakuva jangile chonda chealongile Nguluvi chevechile “Ndakyene,” kuchumbile Yesu Kilisito. Ndeni, ena lyetu yetuilonga kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito, tukuilonga kwa kumnjuma Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Nguluvi yumwene nde akutugita nefwe na nyenye tuveche vagangafu kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, Nguluvi yumwene nde atuhagule nefwe, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />yumwene atuvikile kimanyilo yeiwonesa kuva nefwe ndi vanu vake na atugavile Muhe vake munumbula chetu, kuwonesa kuva ndakyene kwa gala gyonda gyeatuvikile. <verse eid="2CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nguluvi ndi mswida vangu na akuichela numbula lyangu! Nene sendikachile kangi ku Kolindo neke ndibihile kuvalakilila kwa gala mahofu gemugagitile. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Setukela kuvang'ang'anicha nyenye mudikile kinu liki, nefwe tuchela kuva muhimile ukangafu muludikilo lwenu, ila tugita kasi pamwi na nyenye kwa jili lya lukeduko lwenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ndeni, ndilamuwe sendikuvagendeliye kangi neke ndibihile kuvaswingwimika. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Kwakuva ndikivaswigwimicha nyenye, ndi ani daakunikedusa? Nyenye vanu yendivaswigwime. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Nde kwakuva ndivasimbiliye baluwa iyi, neke pendikwacha kwa nyenye ndibihile kuswigwima na vanu vala vala vevang'ang'ilwe kunikedusa. Ndichela kuva nene ndikikeduka na nyenye ndeni ndeni mwikeduka. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Mubaluwa yila, ndikavasimbiliye ndikiva na uswingwimo kuno nding'ung'ula na kuvemba, sending'ang'ile kuvaswigwimicha, ila kuvawonesa kuva ndikuvakela hilo.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvawonela lusungu vanu vevatugitile nongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ngita kuna munu amswigwimiche muyage, seakuniswigwimicha nene hela, ila akuvaswigwimicha nyenye vonda, nene ndilema kuvecha mng'ali hilo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Lihigo yeahigilwe munu uyo na vanu volofu, imkwiliye. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Kyekisigaliye nondee, mumuwonele lusungu nongwa chake na kumgangamicha neke abihile kuswigwima hilo na kutwinyika ludoboko. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ndeni ndikuvasuka hilo, muwonese kuva mukumkela. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ndikavasimbiliye baluwa yila, kwakuva ndikasakile kuchela kuva mukunipulikicha mukila kinu kyendilonga. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Pemumuwonela lusungu munu yoyonda nongwa chake, ndeni ndeni nene ndikumuwonela lusungu nongwa chake, kwakuva pendikimuwonela lusungu munu nongwa chake, ngita ndakyene kugehe na kyokyonda kya kuwonela lusungu, ndikumuwonela lusungu pautalo lya Kilisito kwakuva lyenu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />neke tubihile kumuleka Setani atuchange, kwakuva twichela kyeakela kugita.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ikogopa kwikala mumwani va Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Pendifikile mumwani va Tiloa kuvadalikila vanu Njowo Nofu cha Kilisito, Mtwa akavagitile vanu vewese kunipulikicha. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ila ndikali ndihela lutengamaso, kwakuva sendikamwene mkolo vangu Tito. Ndeni ndikavalagile vanu ndikahele ku Makedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usindi kuchumbila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ila tukumuhongecha Nguluvi yeakutugita twilongochane kwa usindi tukivecha twiwungane na Kilisito. Mwene akutugita tudalika njowo cha kumchela Kilisito ngita manung'ililo manofu gegilutala kila pono. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kwakuva nefwe ndi ngita manung'ililo manofu ga ubani ambago Kilisito akumuhechela Nguluvi, manung'ililo manofu yikuvafikila vonda, kwa vala vevilowolwa na kwa vala veviyaga. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kwa vala veviyaga, nefwe ndi manung'ililo ginung'a gyegiletela kufua, ila kwa vala vevilowolwa, nefwe ndi manung'ililo manofu gyegiletela uwumi. Nde ani yeing'ang'wa kugita kasi iyi? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Nefwe sengita vanu vangi vevigitile Njowo Nofu lya Nguluvi ngita kinu kyakuguchwa, nefwe kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, tulonga undakyene pautalo lwa Nguluvi, ngita vanu yetulagichwe na Nguluvi.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Vandumindumi va Lyagano Limiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Wuli, twivanga kangi kwinjuma vavene? Awu tung'ang'wa baluwa lya kwitambucha kwa nyenye awu kusuka baluwa kuhuma kwa nyenye neke vanu vangi vatutambule, ngita pevigita vanu vangi? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Nyenye vavene ndi baluwa lyetu yeisimbilwe munumbula chetu kila yumwi ailole na kuikwimba. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Muchelwa kuva nyenye ndi baluwa lya Kilisito yeihumile na kasi lyetu. Baluwa yene seisimbilwe kwa wino, ila isimbilwe na Muhe va Nguluvi yeagehe wumi, seisimbilwe kukyanya lya liganga, ila munumbula cha vanu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Tuwesa kulonga ndeni, kwakuva lya luhuvililo lyetu lyetugehe nalyo kwa Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Setuwesa kulonga kuva tugitile makani gyonda kwa umwimike vetu vavene, ila umwimike vetu vetuunago uhuma kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Mwene nde atutangile kugumbanikila Lyagano Limiya ambalyo selyagano lya lulagilicho lyelisimbilwe, ila ndi lyagano lya Muhe va Nguluvi. Kwakuva lulagilicho lyelisimbilwe ligita kufuwa, ila Muhe va Nguluvi iletela wumi.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Suwe, ikiva wula lulagilicho yeiletile kufuwa, yeisimbilwe kwa kuhongola mufipande fya figanga, ikachile kwa ukomi ata Vaisilaeli sevawesile kuulola wuso va Musa kwakuva lya ung'alo vake, nago ukali ukomi va chipindi hela, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />wuli, kasi lya Muhe va Nguluvi sedaivecha na ung'alo hilo? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ngita kasi yeihiga vanu ndi kasi ngomi, wuli kasi yeileta ulowola sedaivecha na ung'alo hilo? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Nondee, ukomi va Lyagano Dahila seuwana na ukomi va Lyagano Limiya, kwakuva ukomi va Lyagano Limiya ndi ngomi hilo. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Kwakuva kikali chipindi chidodo hela cha ukomi, ndeni kila kyekwikala kwa chipindi kitali dakivecha na ukomi hilo. <verse eid="2CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Suwe, kwakuva ulo luhuvililo lwetu, tulonga ngajila uwogofi. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Nefwe setuwana na Musa, akang'ang'ile kugubika wuso vake kwa kindimula neke vanu va Isilaeli vabihile kuulola mwiso va ung'alo veukali utinala. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ila luhala chawo chikagubuchwe. Mbaka neng'uli pelikwimba Lyagano lya Daha, kindimula iko wave ugehe ugubike luhala chawo. Kindimula iko kihechwa pala munu akimdikila Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Ndakyene, mbaka neng'uli pevikwimba lulagilicho lwa Musa, kindimula iko kigubika luhala chawo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ila kindimula iko kihechwa pala munu peakumsedukila Mtwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Ndeni, “Mtwa” Ndi Muhe, na pala peagehe Muhe va Mtwa kuna upekesu. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Suwe, nefwe vonda wuso vetu sechigubikwa kwa kindimula, twiwonesa ukomi va Mtwa ngita mulundala pekiwonesa picha, nefwe tuwoneswa kuhuma muukomi umwi mbaka ku ukomi hilo. Mtwa nde muhe na nde igita kasi iyo.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Finu fya kimuhe mufiviya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Suwe, Nguluvi kwa lusungu lyake, akatugavile kasi iyi na ndeni dasetutwinyika numbula. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Suwe, tugalekile makani gyonda gya soni na gya lupwepo. Setukwikala kwa kuvachanga vanu, vala kuhanganya luchowo lya Nguluvi na udesi. Ila tulonga undankyene pautalo lwa Nguluvi, neke vanu vangi vahoche munumbula chawo kuva tugehe va undakyene pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ndeni, ngita Njowo Nofu chetudalika ngita seichelwa unofu kwa vanu, suwe, seichelwa kwa vanu vala vevayagile. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Vanu avo sevidikila kwakuva Setani mwene ndi nguluvi va inyi iyi, avikile kisi luhala chawo, neke vabihile kulola welu va Njowo Nofu cha Kilisito, mwene yeakutuwonesa Nguluvi aviye. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Kwakuva setudalika luchowo lwetu vavene, ila tukumdalika Yesu Kilisito yeali Mtwa, nefwe vavene ndi vanjagila venu kwa Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Nguluvi yealongile, “Welu na ulangache kuhuma mukisi,” mwene nde yeilangachila numbula chetu na kutugavila welu va kuchela ukomi va Nguluvi weulangacha muwuso va Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ila Nguluvi atugaviye nefwe fupo lya kudalika unanzi vake. Ila nefwe tuvasosuvafu ngita fiviya. Ila tugehe na ludali ngomi ihuma kwa Nguluvi vala seihuma kwa nefwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Figono fyonda nefwe tupata utumama, ila setulemwa, tupata wogofi, ila setutwinyika numbula. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Tugehe na vachwindwama volofu vakutugudisa ila tutangwa, tuguwa panyi ila setuhanangwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Figono fyonda vanu visaka kutudocha ngita peikali kwa Yesu, neke uwumi va Yesu uwoneke mumvili vetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Kwa nefwe yetugehe uwumi twigenda na lufuwo figono fyonda kwakuva lya Yesu, neke uwumi vake uwoneke mumivili gyetu gegifuwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ndeni, kufuwa igita kasi mugati lyetu, ila uwumi ugita kasi mugati lyenu.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Ndikadikiye, ndeni ndikalongile unanzi va Nguluvi.” Kwakuva tugehe na Muhe yuyula va ludikilo, ndeni tudikila na tukwendelela kuulonga unanzi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Twichela kuva yula yeamchulubuwe Mtwa Yesu daatuchulubuwe na nefwe pamwi na Yesu na kutuvika pamwi na mwene pautalo lyake. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Aga gyonda gagitilwe kwakuva lyenu, neke usanzi va Nguluvi peukuvafikila vanu vongofu hilo, kangi vanu avo volofu davamuhongeche Nguluvi kwa kumnjuma hilo.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwikala kwa kudikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ndeni, setutwinyika numbula, ata ngita mivili kwa kwivala givecha migogolo na kusakala, ila muhe chetu chigitwa miya kila kigono. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Utumama wetukuupatila ndi madodo na segikala kwa chipindi hilo, ila dagatuvika unofu neke kwanuka ukomi va mbepali. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Suwe, tubihile kugalola gala gegiwoneka, ila tugalole gala segiwoneka. Kwakuva gala gegiwoneka segikala kwa chipindi chitali, ila gala segiwoneka gikala mbepali.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kwakuva mivili gyetu ngita kyama gyegikala muinyi iyi daihanangika. Ila tuchela kuva Nguluvi datugavila kaye yingi kuluhano, kaye seichengilwe kwa mawoko gya vanu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Nondee, petwali mumvili ugu muinyi iyi tung'ung'ulika. Tusaka kuhelela na kwikala mukaye iyo ukoya kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Baho, Nguluvi dakutugavila mivili miya muhe chetu dachivecha na mivili gya kwikala mugati lyake mbepali. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Tukiva twave mukyama iki kya inyi yene ndi mivili gyetu, tung'ung'ulika mugati lyetu kuhumila na makani molofu makangafu gyegakutuhumila, sengita tukela kuhufula mvili ugu veufuwa, ila tukela kufwaliswa mvili seufuwa, neke muvili ugu weufuwa ugalambuchwe na muvili weseufuwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nguluvi mwene nde yeagita makani aga gyonda, mwene akatugavile Muhe vake neke atuwonese kuva kwa undakyene daakugagita. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ndeni, figono fyonda tugangamichwa. Tuchela kuva petukwikala kwa muvili ugu hela ndi kwikala kutali na kaye lya Mtwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Kwakuva, tukwikala kwa kudikila na sekwa gala getukugalola. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ndakyene tugehe na ukakatima na kusaka kuuleka mvili ugu na tukakale pamwi na Mtwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ila lukani linofu hilo, tusaka kumkelesa Mtwa, yiveche tukwikala paha muinyi awu ukoya kuluhano. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kwakuva, kila munu daikwima pautalo lya Kilisito neke ahigwe. Kila munu daiwanuka kyeang'ang'wa kuwanuka kwa gala geagitile peagehe muinyi, gaveche manofu awu mawofu.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njengakaya na Nguluvi kuchumbila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Suwe, tuchela kumginya hilo Mtwa, ndeni tukuvayovelecha vanu vamudikiye Kilisito. Nguluvi akutuchela unofu petugehe na nene ndihuvilila mukutuchela unofu munumbula chenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Setukela kangi kwinjuma kwa nyenye. Ila tusaka kuvalongela kila kyemung'ang'wa kwinjuma kwakuva lya nefwe, neke muveche na makani kya kuvahiga vala vevikwinjuma pautalo lya vanu na valeka kwidumbila gegagehe munumbula chawo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Kwa vanu vangi, tuwoneka tugehe na lukwale, kwakuva lya kumgumbanikila Nguluvi, ila ngita tuwoneka tugehe na luhala lunofu suwe nde kwakuva lya kuvatanga nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Tulongochwa na ukelo va Kilisito, nondee tuchela munu yumwi akafuwe kwakuva lya vanu vonda, ndeni vanu vonda vafuwe pamwi na mwene. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Mwene akafuwe kwakuva lya vanu vonda, neke vala vevagehe uwumi vabihile kwikala kwa kuyikela vavene, ila vakale kwa jili lyake, mwene yeafuwe na kuchulubuka kwakuva lya vene.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Setukumlola munu yeyonda na kumgecha kwa kimunu, ata ngita tukamchele Yesu Kilisito kwa kumgela, ila nondee setugita ndeni kangi. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ata yivechile munu yeyonda agehe mugati lya Kilisito avechile munu mumiya, gadahile gachumbile na gamiya gachile. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Aga gyonda gihuma kwa Nguluvi, yeatunjengilekaya nefwe na mwene kuchumbila Kilisito, na kutugavila kasi lya kuvanjengakaya vanu na Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Nde kulonga, Nguluvi yumwene akali akunjengakaya vanu vonda na mwene kwa kuchumbila kilisito ngajila kuvalila sambi chawo. Mwene akatugavile unanzi va kunjengakaya. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ila nefwe tulagichwe na Kilisito tulonge na vanu, Nguluvi yumweme akututumile nefwe kuvasuka hilo nyenye. Nefwe, tukuvasuka kwa litawa lya Kilisito, neke munjengwekaya na Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kilisito seakali na sambi, ila Nguluvi akamgitile ategule sambi chetu, neke nefwe kwa kwiwunga na mwene, tuveche vanu vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nefwe tukigita kasi pamwi na Nguluvi, tukuvasuka hilo usanzi va Nguluvi vemuuwanuke ubihile kuyaga hela. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Nguluvi ilonga ndena mumasimbo gyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Muchipindi chechitakilwa ndikakupulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">mukigono kya ulowolwa ndikavatangile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">Sewe, nondee ndi chipindi chene nde neng'uli ndi kigono kya kukombolilwa! <verse eid="2CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Nondee tubihile kugita lolonda lyeligehe ngingamo kwa vangi, neke uchulila vetu ubihile kulongwa uwofu. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Pambele lyake, tung'ang'wa kwiwonesa kuva ndakyene nefwe ndi vandumindumi va Nguluvi kwa kuhuvilila utatala na magudo na utumama. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Tukatovilwe, tukawopilwe mukiwopo na tukayovelechwe kwa vanu na tukagitile kasi ngajila kutulula na kwikala ngajila kuliya. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Kangi tukayiwonesa kuva nefwe ndi ndumindumi va Nguluvi kwa kukala kwa kumkelesa Nguluvi, kwa numbula nofu na luchelo na kwa luhuvililo na usanzi, kwakulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi na kwa lukelo va undakyene, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />na kwa unanzi va undakyene vetukuulanducha na kugita gala gye gya kumkelesa Nguluvi. Undakyene ndi kyalukilo yeitumila kutovanila na kwidima. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Tuginywa na kubedwa, tuligwa na kunjumwa. Tuwoneka kuva vadesi ila tulonga undakyene, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />ngita vanu setuchelanike, ila kuno tuchelanika na vanu vonda, ngita vanu vefafuwe ila tugehe wumi. Tukatovilwe ila setukafuwe. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Tukivecha ngita vanu vevagehe na uswingwimo ila figono fyonda tukeduka, ngita vanu vahangala ila tukuvagavila umosi vanu volofu, ata ngita tuwoneka tuhela kinu ila tuwoneka tugehe na kila kinu. <verse eid="2CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Vakolo vangu va Kolindo! Tukavalongile wachi wachi na tukuvawonesa tukavakela hilo. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ila nefwe setulekile kuvakela nyenye, ila nyenye mulekile kutukela nefwe. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Nondee ndilonga na nyenye ngita fila vana vangu. Muveche na lukelo lukomi ngita nefwe petugehe.”<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubihile kwiwunga na vanu sevamudikiye Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Mubihile kwiwunga na vanu sevamudikiye Nguluvi. Wuli, usanzi na uwofu fiwana? Welu na kisi fiwesa kwikala pamwi? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kilisito iwesa wuli kunjengakaya na Setani? Nondee, iwesekana wuli munu yeamudikiye Kilisito na munu yeseamudikiye Kilisito kuvecha vaganja? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Kaye lya Nguluvi iwesa wulikuvecha kinu kimwi na ling'omong'omo cha udesi? Kwakuva nefwe ndi kaye lya Nguluvi yeagehe wumi. Ngita Nguluvi yumwene pealongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Dandikala navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na kugenda pamwi navo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Dandivecha Nguluvi vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">navo davavecha vanu vangu.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Nondee, Mtwa ilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Muhege pagati lyenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mukayinenge navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mubihile kukolela finu sefiidikilwa mukumfunya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">nene dandikuvawanuka. <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Nene dandivecha Daada venu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Na nyenye damuvecha vana vangu vakigosi kwa vakidala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Ndi nene Mtwa Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Mwene ludali chonda yendilonga.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Vakolo vangu, kwakuva tugavilwe jangila ichi, ndeni tuying'aliche na tuleke makani gyonda gegakutugita mivili gyetu na muhe chetu chibihile kudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi, tuveche vanu va Nguluvi na kwikala kwa kumginya Nguluvi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukeduko lwa Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Vakolo vangu twisuka mutukele! Setukamukosiye munu yeyonda, setukamulemacha munu yeyonda vala setukamuchangile munu yeyonda. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Sendilonga aga neke ndivahige nyenye kuva mugehe na nongwa, ngita pendilonguwe kulonga kuva nyenye tukuvakela, tufuwe pamwi na nyenye awu tuveche uwumi pamwi na nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ndikuvaidikila nyenye nde vakangafu, ndikwidumbila nyenye. Mumagudo gyetu gyonda ndi gangamichwa numbula na ndikeduka hilo. <verse eid="2CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Kwakuva ata petufikile ku makidoniya setukawesile kutulula. Kila lubali kukali na utumama, kwivala kukali na ndewo na munumbula chetu kukali uwogofi. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ila Nguluvi, yeakuvagangamicha yevatwinyike numbula, akatugangamicha numbula peaachile Tito. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Sekwacha kwa Tito hela, ila ndeni ndeni akatulongiye pemukamugangamicha. Mwene akatulongiye pemusaka hilo kuniwona na pemugehe na uswigwimo kwa gala gegihumile na pemusaka kunitasa, nondee ndikeduka hilo. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ata ngita ndikavaswigwimiche kwa baluwa yila, nene sendikwiswitilicha. Ata ngita ngandikwiswitiliche, ndichela baluwa iyo ikavaswigwimiche ila kwa chipindi chidodo hela. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ila nondee ndikedukila, sekwakuva ndikavagitile musugwime, ila kwakuva usugwimo venu ukaletilwe na Nguluvi neke mugalambule na kuleka sambi. Ila nefwe setukavalemacha kwa kyokyonda. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kusugwima yeiletwa na Nguluvi ikuvagita vanu valeke sambi neke vakomboliwe, ila usugwimo va inyi ikumsindika munu kufuwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Nondee, muchela uswigwimo yeiletilwe na Nguluvi, peigitile kasi kwa nyenye, ivaletile makani manofu ivagitile muveche na ludoboko va kugita makani gye king'ang'wa, mwiwesa kwilongela kwa aga gye mukugagita kuva nde gya undakyene, muwesa kukana manjanganifu, kumuginya Nguluvi, kwa ng'elu lya kundilola na kulola munu ye agitile nongwa daipata daigitwa ngita ing'ang'a. Muago gyonda muwonesa kuva mwihela nongwa musaka kulolesa numbula chenu pechigehe nofu. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ndeni, ata ngita ndikavasimbiliye baluwa yila se kwa jili lya munu yeagitile mahofu awu kwa jili lya munu yeseagitilwe mahofu. Ila ndikasimbile neke kuvavika wachi pautalo lya Nguluvi, neke mulole, pemwihecha kutugumbanikila. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ndeni, tukagangamichwe numbula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Sekugangamichwa numbula hela ndeni ndeni tukakeduka kumuwona Tito ana lukeduko, kangi pemukedusile munumbula lyake. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Nene ndikayinjuma hilo pautalo lyake kwakuva lyenu na nyenye semukanigavile nyoni. Figono fyonda tukavalongile undakyene na kwidumbila nyenye pautalo lya Tito ikawonise lukani lwa undakyene. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ndeni lukelo lwake kwa nyeye ndi lukomi hilo, peiwuwika peadikilwe na peamuwanuke kwa uwogofi na kulindima. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ndikeduka hilo kwakuva ndiwesa kuvahuvilila nyenye kwa kila lukani.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuhecha kwa numbula lya kukela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Nondee vakolo vangu, tukela kuvalongela usanzi va Nguluvi veagavile lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ukoya ku Makedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Vanu avo vevamudikiye Kilisito vakagechilwe hilo kwa utumama, ila luhekelelo lwao lukali ngomi na ikavagitile vanu vakele hilo kutaula finu, ata ngita vakali vahangala hilo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela vakahechile ngita pevawesile ata kugina umwimike vawo, kwihela munu yeakavalongiye ila vakakeliye vavene, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />vakatusukile hilo, tugite navo kasi lya kuvatanga vanu va Nguluvi vevagehe ukoya ku Yudeya. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Kangi, vakagitile hilo kuchumba petuhuvilile, vayihechile vavene tandi kwa Mtwa na vayihechele na kwa nefwe, kwa lukelo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ndeni tukamusukile hilo Tito, yeavangiche kasi iyo nofu lya kuhecha kwa kukela, avatange nyenye kugita kasi iyi lya lukelo mugati lwenu. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Nyenye ndi mugehe na kila kinu, mugehe na ludikilo na umwimike va kulonga unofu na luchelo na ludali lyonda lwa kugita usanzi na lukelo venu kwa nefwe. Ndeni, tukuhuvilila muveche na numbula lya kuhecha hilo mukasi iyi lya kuvatanga vanu vangi. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Sendikuvaswitilicha, ila ndikela kugecha lukelo venu kuva nde va undakyene na uwana na vanu vangi vevagehe na ugangamalo lya kutanga neke ndiwese kuchela namuna lukelo venu peugehe va undakyene. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Kwakuva, nyenye muchela usanzi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, ata ngita mweni akali na kila kinu, akayigitile muhangala kwa jili lyenu, neke kuchumbila uhuhangala veke, nyenye muveche na kila kinu.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ila kyendisaka kuvalongela nde iki, ndi unofu kwa nyenye kugita fila fimuvangile mwaka weuchumbile. Nyenye mukali va kwanja sekuhecha hela finu fyenu, ila mukakelile hilo lya kusaka kwihecha. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Suwe, mumale kasi iyi lya kuhecha kwa lukelo, ngita pemugehe na ng'elu ngomi lya kutanga, ndeni, muhecha ngita pemuwesa kuhecha. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ngita munu akela kuhecha, Nguluvi iwanuka kila kyeawesa kuhecha kuhumila na kila kiagehe nakyo, Nguluvi seisaka hilo.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Natilo lyetu sekulonga nyenye mgudiswe na mchigo va kuvatanga vanu vangi, neke vene vaveche na lutango, ila kyending'ang'a vanu vonda muveche telatela. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Finu fyolofu fyemugehe nafyo nondee fivatanga vayenu vevihela, neke navo dapevivecha na finu vavagavile nyenye pemugehe mwihela kinu, ndeni, kwakugita ndeni muvecha mwitange. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Yealundasile fyolofu, seakali na kinu kingi, vala yealundasile fidodo, seakapwemuke na kinu.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito ilagichwa ku Kolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi yeamgavile Tito ng'elu lya kuvatanga nyenye ngita nene pendegehe na ng'elu lya kuvatanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Seakaidikile hela kila kyetumsukile, ila na mwene akali na ng'elu lya kuvatanga, ata yumwene akasakile hilo kwacha kwa nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Pamwi na Tito, tukumulagicha lukolo yumwi yeanjumwile na lipinga lya vanu vonda vevamuidikiye Kilisito kwa kasi lyake lya kulanducha Njowo Nofu. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kangi mapinga gya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito vamuhaguwe lukolo vetu uyo neke aveche pamwi na nefwe petukusindika lutango kwa vanu. Kasi ilyo yikumnjuma Mtwa, kangi iwonesa kuva twikela kuvatanga vanu.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Twigenda na lukolo uyo, neke kwihepa luchogomecho lolonda petwigawa fupo chechihechwa kwa usanzi. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Natilo lyetu ndi kugita makani ganofu sekwa Mtwa ng'ani ila ata pautalo lya vanu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Ndenindeni tukumlagilicha lukolo vetu pamwi navo, malacholofu tukamgechile na tukamuwene agehe na numbula lya kuvatanga vanu, nondee agehe na ng'elu lya kuvatanga hilo kwakuva akuvaidikila hilo nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Titusi nde mweyangu twigita kasi pamwi kwajili lya nyenye. Ila kutigila lukolo vetu ava vangi vevikwacha pamwi na mwene avo vihuma mumapinga gya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito, navo vakumnjuma Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Suwe, muvaonese vanu avo lukelo venu neke mapinga gangi gya vanu veamuidikiye Kilisito vachele kuva gyetulonga nde gyaundakyene ndeni tukwidumbila nyenye.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Mutange vadikilwa vayenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ndeni, nene sending'ang'wa hilo kuvasimbilya ngajila lya kasi lya kuvatanga vanu va Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ndichela pemugehe na numbula lya kuvatanga vanu vangi na ndikayidumbile lukani ulo kwa vanu vevavamuidikiye Kilisto ku Makedoniya. Ndikavalongile, “Vakolo vetu va Akaya vagehe tayali kutanga kuhuma mwaka veuchumbile.” Ndeni, numbula lyenu lya kuhecha ivayovelechile vanu volofu vaheche hilo. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Suwe, ndivalagicha vakalo vetu avo, neke kwidumbila kwa nefwe kwajili lya nyenye kubihile kuwoneka ndi njowo hela. Ila yiwoneke mwiyandalise na mgehe na finu fya kuvatanga ngita pendilongile. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Kwakuva ngita vanu va Makedoniya davikwacha pamwi na nene na kuvalola semwiyandalise, datwilola nyoni ngajila kulonga kyokyonda kutigila nyenye na nyenye ndenindeni damulola nyoni kwakuva tukali tuvahuviliye hilo. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ndeni, ndiwene unofu kuvasuka ava vakolo vandilonguwe kwacha kwa nyenye, vapate kuandalisa fupo chenu ngomi chemlongile damwihecha. Baho yiwonesa kuva fupo ilyo muhechile vavene na se kwa kuswitilichwa. <verse eid="2CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Muwiwuke, munu yeivala mbenyu chikefu ibena chikefu, munu yeivala mbeyu chongofu ibena chongofu. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Suwe, kila yumwi, aheche ngita pealamule kwa numbula na se kwa uswigwimo awu kwa kuswitilichwa, kwakuva Nguluvi umkela yula munya kuhecha kwa lukeduko. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Nguluvi iwesa kuvagavila nyenye kugina gala gemwisaka, neke chipindi chonda muveche na kila kinu kyemung'ang'a, neke muveche vanu va kugita manofu myolofu kuvatanga vanu vangi. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Mwene kuhecha kwa numbula lya kukela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">uvagavila vahangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">usanzi vake ukwikala mbepali.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nguluvi yeakumgavila mgima mbeyu na nde yeakumgavila kyakula, davakuvagavila nyenye ndeni mbeyu chemng'ang'a na dachigita chimele na kukula na kuvagavila mabenelo myolofu gyemukugapata kwajili lya kuhecha kwa nyenye kwa numbula nofu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Dakuvagita muveche na kila kinu figono fyonda, neke vanu vawese kumuhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva lya fupo chenu chevawanuka kwa kuhumila nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Kwakuva, kasi iyi lya Nguluvi yemukuigita seikuvatanga vanu va Nguluvi weka hela, ila daikuvagita vanu volofu vamuhongeche Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Kuhumila na gala gyegiwoneka mukasi lyetu iyi vanu davakumnjuma Nguluvi, kwakuva lya nyenye kudikila Njowo Nofu cha Kilisito chemudalika, kangi kwakuva lya numbula lya kukela kuvagavila vanu vonda finu fyenu. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Ndeni, davakuvasukila nyenye kwa numbula kwakuva lya usanzi mkomi weavagavile Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tumuhongeche Nguluvi kwakuva lya fupo lyake ngomi yeatugaviye yeseiwesa kulongwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulo akuyitasa Kasi lyake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nene Paulo, ndiwoneka kuva mfokomasi pendikali na nyenye, ila mng'ali pendivecha kutali na nyenye ngita vanu vangi pevilonga, ndikuvasuka kwa lusungu na usanzi vake Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ndikuvasuka msindigite kuvecha mng'ali chipindi pendikwacha, kwakuva ndiwesa kulonga undakyene kuva ndiwesa kuva mng'ali kwa vala vonda vevakutuchela kuva tukwikala muinyi hela. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ata ngita tukwikala muinyi, ila setukwitova fita ngita vanu va muinyi iyi pevikwitova fita. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Kyalukilo fyetutumila mufita fyetu sekyalukilo fya muinyi iyi, ila ndi ludali cha Nguluvi chene kuhananga lugombo chonda cha vachindwama. Tunahananga makani gyonda gya udesi, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />tukwibata kwa ludali mahocho na kila kinu kyekikang'isa, kila kinu kyekivikilwe kukanicha Njowo nofu cha Nguluvi na kuchigita luhala chonda chimudikile Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Pemukali muidikiye hilo, suwe nefwe twiandalise kutova kila munu yeseidikila. <verse eid="2CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Nyenye mwilola makani aga kwa kwivala hela. Wuli, koyuli munu yoyonda akwichela kuva mwene ndi munu va Kilisito? Suwe, ahoche kuva nefwe kangi ndi va Kilisito ngita mwene peakali munu va Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Sendilola nyoni kwidumba kwa umwimike veandigavile Mtwa kwakuva umwimike uvo nde kwaajili lya kuvatanga nyenye na sekwakuvahananga ila kuvachenga muidikilo. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ndilema muwoche kuva ndikela kuvawogofya kwa baluwa chanene. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Munu iwesa kulonga, “Baluwa cha Paulo ndi ng'ali na chigehe na malichwi mang'ali, ila mwene peagehe na nefwe ndi munu msosovafu na peilonga malichwi gyake sekinu!” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Munu ngita uyo na ahoche ndena, kuva ngita peisimbilwe mubaluwa. Chipindi tugehe kutali na gala getukugagita chipindi dapetukali pamwi. <verse eid="2CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Setwikela kwivika awu kwiwananisa na vala vanu vevakwinjuma vavene. Vanu avo vakwigele vavene na kwiwananisa vavene kwa vavene, vene ndi vapufi. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ila nefwe dasetukwidumba hilo, kwidumba kwa nefwe daivecha mukasi yeatugavile Nguluvi, kasi yeifikile mbaka kwa nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Nefwe setukachumbaniche kwinjuma kwa nefwe. Nefwe nde tulonguwe kuvaletela Njowo Nofu lya Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Suwe, setukwidumba kwa kasi yevagitile vanu vangi saidi lya kigelo cheatuvikile Nguluvi, ila tuhuvilila kuva kudikila kwa nyenye dakuhongeleka tuwese kugita kasi ngomi mugati lyenu, kufwatila peikela Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Baho, tuwisa kudalika Njowo Nofu muinyi chingi chechigehe kutali na nyenye. Kwakuva setung'ang'a kwidumbila kasi yeigitilwe na munu yungi na pono pangi. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ila ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, “Mwene kwidumba na ayidumbile kasi lya Mtwa.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Kwakuva yeidikilwa seyula yekwijuma yumwene, ila ndi yula yeinjumwa na Mtwa.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Vanjagila veviwulanicha udesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ndikeliye ngita ngamundihuvilile ludodo, ata ngita nene ndilonga upufi! Nondee, munihuvilile ludodo. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ndikuvawonela wifu, ila wifu va Nguluvi, kwakuva nyenye ndi ngita mkigoli yeahechiliwe njachika kwa mgosi yumwi hela nde Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ila ndiwogofya kuva ngita liyoka peamchangile Eva kwa uwofu vake, nyenye damchanga na kuleka kumkela Kilisito kwa numbula chenu chechigehe nofu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Kwakuva munu yeyonda yeikwacha kwa nyenye na kuvadalikila unanzi va Kilisito seuwanile na wula tukavadalikile nefwe, nyenye mukamuwanuke kwa mawoko mavili awu mukaidikiye Muhe yungi, baho mukawanuke unanzi wungi na se Njowo Nofu yetukavadalikile. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Sendihocha kuva nene ndi mdodo kuchumba avo veviyikemela, “Vanjagila vakomi.” <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Pangi nene sendiwesa kulonga unofu, ila luchelo ndi nalyo, lukani ulu tuligitile lichelwe kwa nyenye kila pono na figono fyonda.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Nene ndikavadalikile Njowo Nofu cha Nguluvi ngajila kusuka mahombo, ndikayikwise neke ndipatile kuvakang'icha nyenye. Wuli, ndikagitile nongwa? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Pendikagitile kasi pagati lyenu, finu fyolofu ndikagavile na mapinga gangi gya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito, kwa kugita ndeni ndi ngita fila ndivanyagile finu fyawo neke ndipatile kuvagundamikila nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Nene pendikali na nyenye, pendipwemwike na kinu chochonde, sendikasakile kuvagavila utumama, kwakuva vakolo vevahumile ku Makadoniya vakandigawiye kila kinu. Ndeni sendikasakile kuvasuka kinu kyokyonda, ata nondee ndigita ndeni. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Ngita ndeni undakyene va Kilisito veugehe mugati lyangu, kwihela munu yeyonda muinyi lya Akaya yeiwesa kunikanila kwidumbila lukani ulu. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ndilonga ndeni sekwakuva sendikuvakela? Hamu, Nguluvi yumwene ichela kuva nene ndikuvakela hilo!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Dandikwendela kugita ndena ngita pendigita nondee, neke vanjagila vala veviyikemela vakomi vabihile kwidumba kuva vigita kasi ngita nefwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Vanu ava ndi vanjagila va udesi, vigita kasi lya kuvachanga vanu, vakwigita vene kuva vanjagila va Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Mubihile kududuva, ata Setani yumwene iwesa kwiyigita ngita ndumindumi va welu! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Kwa ndeni, selukani lwa kududuva, ngita vandumindumi va Setani vakwigita vene kuva vandumindumi vasanzi kwa Nguluvi, ila umalilo vawo daviwanuka mahombo gyawo ngita pevagitile kasi.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magudo gegakumpatila Paulo kwakuva mnjagila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ndilonga kangi, munu yeyonda abihile kuhocha kuva nene ndi mpufi, Ila ata ngita mukichela ndeni muniwanuke ngita mpufi neke na nene ndipatile kwinjuma ata ngita kwa ludodo. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Kyendilonga nondee sekila kyealagiliche Mtwa ndikilonge, ila kutigila lukani ulu lwa kwidumba nene ndilonga ngita mpufi. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Kwakuva vanu volofu vakwidumba ngita vanu va muinyi iyi na nene ndeni ndikwidumba. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Nyenye mukwilola mugehe na luhala, nde kwakuva mukuvahuvilila vanu vapufi. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mukumuhuvilila ata munu yeakuvagita nyenye vasutu, munu yeakuvaichila na kuvanyaga finu fyenu, kangi akwinjuma na kuvabeda na yeakuvatova mumeho! <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Tuwona nyoni kulonga kuva nefwe tuvasosovafu kugita ndeni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ngita vene vawesile kwidumba ata nene nganiwesile kwidumba ila ndilola ndi upufi hela. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ngita vene ndi Vaibulaniya? Na nene ndeni ndeni Muibulania. Ngita vene ndi Vaisilaeli? Na nene ndeni ndeni ndi Muisilaeli. Ngita vene ndi ulelo va Ibulahimu? Na nene ndeni ndeni ndihuma muulelo va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Wuli, vene ndi vandumindumi va Kilisito? Na nene ndilonga ngita munya lukwale, nene ndi mnyigendwa mnofu va Kilisito kuchumba vene. Nene ndigita kasi ng'angafu kuchumba vene, nene ndikawopilwe mukiwopo mala chongofu na nditovilwe mala chongofu na ndikali pepi kufuwa mala chongofu. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Mala chihano ndikatovilwe ndomondo kyumi chidatu na nyigonza na Vayawudi. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ndikatovilwe ndomondo mala chidatu na Valoma na ndikatovilwe maganga mala yimwi neke vanidocha na mala chidatu ndikadenyekiwe na wato muinyanza na ukoya ndikakalile meho muinyanza lumiye lyonda na kuhuwa pamuyi lyonda. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Mulugendo lwangu, ndikali pepi kufuwa kwa kusung'wa na malenga ga ulava, ndikali pepe kufuwa na vang'oko na ndikalipepi kufuwa kuhumila na lukolo vangu Vayawudi kuhumilana na kumdikila Kilisito na ndikali pepi kufuwa mumwani vangu na ndikali pepi kufuwa lya mudasi na ndikali pepi kufuwa muinyanza na ndikali pepi kufuwa kwa kugudiswa na vakolo va udesi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ndikagitile kasi ng'angafu na kugudika na ndikakalile ngajila kugona mala cholofu na ndikakali na njala na ng'elu mala chongofu, mala chongofu ndiyimile kuliya, mala cholofu ndikakalile mung'ala na sendikali na myenda gya kwigubika mung'ala. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Pamwi na ago gyonda, kila kigono ndihocha pakyanya lya mapinga gyonda gya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ngita munu yeyonda ndi musosovafu, nene ndeni ndeni ndivecha musosovafu, ngita munu yoyonda akumgita sambi na nene ndeni ndeni ndivipa. <verse eid="2CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ngita ndikwidumba, suwe, ndikwidumbila gala makani gegiwonesa usosovafu vangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Nguluvi Daada va Mtwa Yesu, anjumwe mbepali, mwene ichela kyendilonga, sendilonga udesi. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Pendikali ku Damasiko, mukomi va mwani yeakali panyi lya ng'achale Alete, akavikile vadima mumilyangilo gya mwani, neke andibate. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ila ndikavikilwe mugati lya kindilu kikomi, ndikakwisilwe kuchumbila fwasi weukali mulukanji, ndikatolwike kuhuma kwa mwene.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Makani geawoniswe Paulo na geagubutuliwe na Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Nene ndiendelela kwidumba ata ngita seunofu! Ila nondee ndilonga makani geaniwonisile Mtwa na kunigubutuliya. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ndikamchele munu yumwi yeamudikiye Kilisito, myaka kyumi na chitai gyegichumbile, akanyamuliwe kuhelela kuluhano hilo. Ila sendichela akwikala ukoya kwa muvili awu kwa muhe va Nguluvi yumwene nde yeichela. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ndilonga kangi, sendichela kuva munu uyo, akwikala kwa muvili awu kwa muhe Nguluvi yumwene ndi yeichela. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Akanyamulwa mbaka pono pepikemelwa Paladiso ukoya kuluhano, akapulike makani segilongeka, ambagyo munu yeyonda seing'ang'wa kugalonga. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ndikwidumbila munu ngita uyo, ila sendikwidumbila yune, ila ndikwidumbila makani gegiwonesa usosovafu vangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ngandikeliye kwidumbila, ngandivecha mupufi kwakuva ngandilongiye undakyene. Ila ndikayikanile mwene, neke vanu vabihile kunilola kuva nene ndimukomi kugina gala gevagalola na kupulika kuhuma kwa nene. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Neke makani aga makomi gegigubutuliwe, ndbihile kwidumbila, ndigagavilwe ung'ali ukomi muvili vangu ngita ung'ali ngita ndihomilwe na mihomi. Mang'ali ago ngita ndumindumi va Setani yealagichwe neke anigudise ndibihile kwidumba hilo. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ndikamsukile hilo Mtwa mala chidatu neke kinu ikyo kinihege. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Ila Mtwa akanilongile, “Usanzi vangu ukwiliye, kwakuva ludali lwangu ivecha ngomi pale peuvecha msosovafu.” Ndeni, ndikwidumba kwa usosovafu vangu, neke ludali lwa Kilisito lukali kwa nene. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ndeni, ndikedukila usosovafu, pendiligwa, pendigudika, pendiutumama kwakuva lya Kilisito. Pendivecha musosovafu baho Kilisito dahunigavila ludali.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ndi ndumindumi va undakyene va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ndikali ngita mupufi, ila nyenye nde munigitile ndiveche ndeni. Kwakuva nyenye mukang'ang'ilwe muninjume, kwakuva ata ndiwoneka ndi mdodo, ila nene se mdodo kuchumba avo, vevakwikemela, “Vanjagila vakomi.” <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Chipindi pendigehe kwa nyenye ndikahuviliye na kugita umanyitu na filuwiluwi fyefikawonesile ndakyene kuva nene ndi mnjagila va Nguluvi. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Kuhela lukani lolonda lyendikaligitile mumapinga gangi gya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito, lyesendikagitile kwa nyenye yivecha ndikavagitiye nongwa kwakuva sendikavasukile munitange kwa finu fyending'ang'a, ngita ilyo lyendigitile ndi nongwa ndisuka muniwonele lusungu.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ndondee, iyi ndi mala lya udatu ndiyiandalise kuvagendelela, nene sendivecha muchigo kwa nyenye. Sendikela finu fyenu ila ndikuvasaka nyenye, kwakuva vana sevakuvavikila finu mulusanja vasasi vawo, ila figono fyonda vasasi nde vivika finu mulusanja kwakuva lya vana vawo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ndikedukila hilo kuhecha fyendinafyo, ata kuyihecha ndimwene neke ndivatange nyenye. Ila yiwoneka nene pendiluticha kuvakele, nyenye mwipwemsa kundikela p <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ila mudikila kuva nene sendikavasumbule kwa kusaka kinu kwa nyenye. Ila munu yungi iwesa kulonga, kwakuva nene ndi msugu, avagomeche kwa kuvachanga. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Wuli, nene ndikavanyagile kinu pala pendimulagiche munu kwacha kwa nyenye? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ndikamulagiche Tito, ache kwa nyenye pamwi na lukolo vetu yungi. Wuli, Tito akategule kinu kyokyonda kwa nyenye? Wuli, semulola kuva nene na mwene ndi kinu kimwi mukasi? Wuli, semulola kuva ata kyanda kyetu ndi kimwi?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Wuli, mwihocha kuva nefwe mbaka nondee tukwitasa pautalo lwenu? Ila twilonga makani aga pautalo lwa Nguluvi, kuno tuhungine na Kilisito. Vaganja vangu, kyokyonda kyetugita, tugita kwa kuvatanga nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Kwakuva ndikogofya pala pendikwacha kwa nyenye dandikuvalola mukwikala ngita pemkela nyenye. Ndeni dasendikeduka, lukani ulo dalikundigita ndigite makani gyesemukugakela, ndikwogopa ndiwesa kuvalola mwikwitova na vimi na kwiwonela wifu na ndewo na kwipinja na ufyangu na kwidumba na luvipo na kuvecha na mayovelecho. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ndikogofya pendikwacha kangi kwa nyenye, Nguluvi vangu daandigita ndiwone nyoni pautalo lyenu. Dandivemba kwakuva lya vala vevigitile sambi kuhuma pamwandi, ila sevakahongeche sambi chawo cha uhafu na ugoni na ludobokelo chiwofu chevakali vagitile.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Lugendo lwa udatu va Paulo kwa Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Iyi ndi mala lya chidatu kwacha kwa nyenye. Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Kila nongwa lihigwa kwa uswida va vanu vavili awu vadatu.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ndikalonguwe kuvalakilila pendikali mulugendo lwa pili, nondee ndilonga kangi ndikiva kutali. Vala vonda vevagitile sambi na sevahongiche, kangi na vala vongi pendikwacha sendikuvawonela lusungu. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Nyenye mwavene damulola kuva Kilisito ilonga kuchumbila nene. Kwa nyenye Kilisito semusosovafu, ila ludali lyake igita kasi mugati lyenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ata ngita avambishwe pakipindilihicho kuno akivecha musosovafu, ila nondee akwikala kwa ludali lwa Nguluvi. Ndeni ndeni nefwe vasosovafu kwa kwiwunga na mwene, ila tukwikala na mwene kwa ludali lwa Nguluvi kwa kuvagitila kasi nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mwiyilolele mwavene muchele kuva muna ludikilo. Mwiyilolele mwavene. Wuli, semuchela kuva Kilisito Yesu agehe mugati lyenu? Ngita se ndeni, suwe, nyenye mulemuwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ila ndidikila kuva nyenye muchela kuva nefwe setukalemuwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Tukumsuka Nguluvi mubihile kugita uwofu wowonda, ila se natilo tuwoneke ngita vanu twetuwesile suwe, ila mugite manofu, ata ngita nefwe tuwoneka tulemuwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kwakuva setuwesa kuupinja undakyene, ila tugine kudalika undakyene. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Tukeduka kuva nefwe vasosovafu, ila nyenye muna ludali, ndeni tukumusuka Nguluvi neke mugine kugita unofu hilo. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Suwe, ndikuvasimbila makani aga ndikiva kutali, neke pendifika kwa nyenye ndibihile kuva mung'ali kwa nyenye, sending'ang'a kutumila umwimike veanigavile Mtwa. Kwakuva Mtwa seandigavile umwimike va kuvahananga ila vakuvatanga muludikilo venu.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ndeni vakolo vangu, nondee ndikuvalagalila! Muveche va undakyene kwa kila kinu, mukolele gendigavalongile, muveche na natilo yimwi, mukale kwa lutengamaso. Na Nguluvi va ukelo na lutengamaso daivecha pamwi na nyenye.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Mwiyihungile kwa ukelo va Kilisito. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Usanzi va Mtwa Yesu Kilisito na lukelo va Nguluvi na kwiwunga na Muhe va Nguluvi, viveche pamwi na nyenye vonda.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Ndisuka Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito Usanzi va Mtwa Yesu Kilisito na lukelo va Nguluvi kwa kwiwunga na Muhe va Nguluvi, viveche na nyenye vonda.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>